<h1>On Spec</h1>

On Spec: The Canadian Magazine Of Speculative Writing is published quarterly as a square-
bound digest-size magazine.  Since the Fall of 1992 it has been edited by an Editorial Collective.
On Spec also maintains its own
<a href="http://www.icomm.ca/onspec/">web site</a>.
<p>

Subscriptions for 1 year (4 issues) are $19.95 (inc GST) in Canada and US$18.00 for USA orders.
Write to:
<pre>
    On Spec
    P.O. Box 4727
    Edmonton, AB
    Canada  T6E 5G6
</pre>
<p>
